#: ../../source/workflows/index.md:1
msgid "Workflows and data flow"
msgstr "工作流程与数据流"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.md:3
msgid "How the tools are chained together, and what data passes between them."
msgstr "各工具如何衔接，以及它们之间传递哪些数据。"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.md:6
msgid ""
"The `cnets` and `cnetml` diagrams below are the reviewed ones — those tools "
"are published and current priority. The [MCMC workflow](#mcmc-workflow-"
"cnetmcmc) diagram for `cnetmcmc` is a draft, since that tool isn't "
"officially released yet."
msgstr ""
"下面 `cnets` 和 `cnetml` 的流程图已经审核过，这两个工具已发表，也是当前的重点。`cnetmcmc` 的 [MCMC 工作流程"
"](#mcmc-workflow-cnetmcmc)图是草稿，因为该工具尚未正式发布。"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.md:12
msgid "Simulation workflow (`cnets`)"
msgstr "模拟流程（`cnets`）"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.md:14
msgid ""
"`cnets` simulates copy-number evolution along a tree and writes simulated "
"copy-number profiles, timing information, mutation lists, and tree files."
msgstr "`cnets` 沿树模拟拷贝数演化，写出模拟的拷贝数谱、时间信息、突变列表和树文件。"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.md:54
msgid "Maximum Likelihood Inference workflow (`cnetml`)"
msgstr "最大似然推断流程（`cnetml`）"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.md:56
msgid ""
"`cnetml` reads observed copy-number profiles and either searches for a "
"maximum-likelihood tree, scores a supplied tree, optimizes a supplied "
"topology, or reconstructs ancestral states."
msgstr "`cnetml` 读取观测到的拷贝数谱，然后搜索最大似然树、为给定的树计算似然、优化给定的拓扑，或重建祖先状态。"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.md:103
msgid ""
"For how the DECOMP likelihood itself is computed once this workflow reaches "
"\"Build likelihood configuration\", see [Architecture](../developer-"
"guide/architecture.md)."
msgstr ""
"流程到达\"Build likelihood configuration\"之后，DECOMP 似然本身如何计算，见[架构](../developer-"
"guide/architecture.md)。"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.md:107
msgid "MCMC workflow (`cnetmcmc`)"
msgstr "MCMC 工作流程（`cnetmcmc`）"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.md:110
msgid ""
"**Draft.** `cnetmcmc` is not yet officially released — current focus is "
"`cnets` and `cnetml`. This diagram was traced from `code/cnetmcmc.cpp` "
"(`main`, `run_mcmc`, `run_with_reference_tree`) rather than from a reviewed "
"design doc, and has not been checked against the running program's actual "
"behaviour. Treat it as a starting point, not a reference."
msgstr ""
"**草稿。** `cnetmcmc` 尚未正式发布，当前重点是 `cnets` 和 `cnetml`。这张图根据 "
"`code/cnetmcmc.cpp`（`main`、`run_mcmc`、`run_with_reference_tree`）整理，不是来自审核过的设计文档，也没有对照程序的实际运行行为检查过。请把它当作起点，而不是权威参考。"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.md:151
msgid ""
"Whether `--rtreefile` is given only decides where the *starting* tree comes "
"from. Whether the topology is actually held fixed during sampling is a "
"separate flag, `fix_topology`, used on both paths — this differs from the "
"summary in the top-level `README.md`, which describes the reference tree "
"itself as fixing the topology."
msgstr ""
"是否提供 `--rtreefile` 只决定*起始*树从哪里来。采样过程中拓扑是否真的固定，由另一个参数 `fix_topology` "
"控制，两条路径都会用到它。这与顶层 `README.md` 中的概述不同，那里说参考树本身会固定拓扑。"

